ion by role and workflow.",{"children":"When a salesperson opens a customer record, open opportunities, recent orders, unpaid invoices, service cases and stock information should be available in the same context. The interface should prioritize this information by role and workflow."}],["$","p","Apex, Lightning Web Components and Flow can create a workspace that not only displays information, but also highlights risk, manages approvals and recommends the next action.",{"children":"Apex, Lightning Web Components and Flow can create a workspace that not only displays information, but also highlights risk, manages approvals and recommends the next action."}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"contact page-contact","children":["$","footer",null,{"className":"shell","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"brand","href":"/","aria-label":"Ana sayfaya dön","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/logo.svg","alt":"Samet ER — Salesforce Developer"}]}],["$","p",null,{"children":["© 2026 Samet ER. Bursa, ","Türkiye","."]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/samet-er-75915a3a3/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"LinkedIn"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/aptus0","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"GitHub"}]]}]]}]}]]}]
